gona» — фото: Dylann Hendricks / Unsplash\" class=\"w-[84px] h-[108px] object-cover grayscale opacity-70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"product photo image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1627470756874-5cbf54508bfc?auto=format&amp;w=200&amp;q=80&amp;fit=crop\"/>\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"product info container\">\n<h3 class=\"fh text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"product title heading\">ПОЛО «BORGONA»</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[9px] text-[#999999] tracking-[0.18em] tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"product SKU code text\">ST-KN-104</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[11px] text-[#999999]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"product description text\">Мериносовый трикотаж, бордо</p>\n<details class=\"mt-3 group\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"sold-out sizes collapsible\" open=\"\">\n<summary class=\"list-none cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-2 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#b83b4b]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"sizes summary toggle\">\n<i class=\"ph ph-minus text-[10px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"collapse minus icon\"></i> Все размеры распроданы\n              </summary>\n<div class=\"mt-2.5 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"sizes container\">\n<span class=\"flex flex-col items-center border border-[#222222] px-2 py-1.5 min-w-11\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"sold out size chip XS\">\n<span class=\"fh text-[10px] text-[#999999] line-through\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"sold out size label XS\">XS</span>\n<span class=\"text-[8px] tabular-nums text-[#999999] mt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"sold out size date\">12.08</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"flex flex-col items-center border border-[#222222] px-2 py-1.5 min-w-11\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"sold out s